# Source spreadsheets from the sourcing team. "SUPPLIER DATA-1.xlsx" is the
# whole WeChat supplier book — 845 factories with names, numbers and WeChat
# IDs — and it is the single most competitively sensitive file in this repo.
# It lives in the database (see scripts/import_suppliers.mjs); it must never
# live in git history, where deleting it later would not remove it.
/*.xlsx
/*.xls
